Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'm fairly sure I could do a Tindalos-style Lodge without it being anything like the True Brujah <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>I'd be curious to see that, but you're busy enough as is.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-30T11:29:44-07:00","id":244902,"title":"","content":"How does one hunt time? Undermine the situation, break the cycle, make sure history doesn't repeat itself? Or does repeat itself? Or unravels entirely?<br /> <br /> Tindalos Lodge: we hunt *potential*.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3070-barbrarilen","name":"Barbrarilen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3070_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"268"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-30T11:34:52-07:00","id":244904,"title":"","content":"They don't hunt time, they hunt time travelers.<br /> It'd be a matter of locking them down, with possibly some ways to yank them back if they manage to flit out of now time.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-30T11:52:30-07:00","id":244917,"title":"","content":"Now I am picturing a big furry arm appearing out of a spiraly time-portal, grabbing someone by the collar and yoinking them through.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3070-barbrarilen","name":"Barbrarilen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3070_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"268"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-30T12:53:29-07:00","id":244945,"title":"","content":"I think less time portal, more appearing 'out of nowhere,' and focus less on the furry and more on the clawed, but yeah that'd be nice image.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-30T14:03:14-07:00","id":244986,"title":"","content":"Alas, I was still mining a vein of fuzzy, bonecrushing comedy. Any other good ideas (maybe more serious ones?) at the intersection of a particular hunting ground and lodge? I come from a d&amp;d tradition where 'prestige' is much less dependent on context and setting... Lodges usually strike me as being very particular. Not even a viable element to a story unless the setting has a niche carved out for it. Maybe that's just my inexperience talking?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3070-barbrarilen","name":"Barbrarilen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3070_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"268"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-30T17:04:01-07:00","id":245068,"title":"","content":"I'm kind of terrified that I seem to have actually kicked something off.<br /> <br /> What tribe do the Hounds draw from, I wonder?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-30T17:18:45-07:00","id":245072,"title":"","content":"A couple of quick options:<br /> <br /> - A Lodge that draws from any tribe (possibly Forsaken and Pure). Members are drawn from those who have experienced temporal weirdness and hunt the transgressors.<br /> <br /> - A new tribe. The followers of Ara-Ur, the Temporal Wolf, whom Father Wolf gave to Mother Luna to teach the passage of time and to know its constant changing nature. Ara-Ur was kidnapped from Luna's care and cast adrift in time, cursed to forever be apart from the natural order of things. Ara-Ur will one day escape her captor, and when she did so she scented the streams of time and saw which wolves she selected as her own. Ara-Ur plucks whelping Uratha who would one day join her from their times and brings them to her den in the swirling wellspring void from which all time starts and ends. Here they fulfill their destinies and join those who hunt the constant streams. They hunt the most dangerous prey - those who flaunt the natural order of events and pervert the flow of time. For which prey is more dangerous than those who can ensure you were never born to stop them?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-30T17:20:37-07:00","id":245073,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/201675-idigam-chronicle-weekly-discussion-hunting-grounds?p=245068#post245068\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm kind of terrified that I seem to have actually kicked something off.<br /> <br /> What tribe do the Hounds draw from, I wonder?</div> </div> </div> </div>This comment made me doubletake slightly because there's a Lodge in one of my sample Hunting Grounds that are just referred to as the Hounds for short <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>- Chris Allen, Aberrant Line Developer, Freelance Writer<br /> <br /> \u200bLike my work? Feel like helping me stay supplied with tea? Check out my <b><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/acrozatarim\" target=\"_blank\">Patreon</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1757-acrozatarim","name":"Acrozatarim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-30T17:51:25-07:00","id":245082,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bunyip</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/201675-idigam-chronicle-weekly-discussion-hunting-grounds?p=245072#post245072\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A couple of quick options:<br /> <br /> - A Lodge that draws from any tribe (possibly Forsaken and Pure). Members are drawn from those who have experienced temporal weirdness and hunt the transgressors.<br /> <br /> - A new tribe. The followers of Ara-Ur, the Temporal Wolf, whom Father Wolf gave to Mother Luna to teach the passage of time and to know its constant changing nature. Ara-Ur was kidnapped from Luna's care and cast adrift in time, cursed to forever be apart from the natural order of things. Ara-Ur will one day escape her captor, and when she did so she scented the streams of time and saw which wolves she selected as her own. Ara-Ur plucks whelping Uratha who would one day join her from their times and brings them to her den in the swirling wellspring void from which all time starts and ends. Here they fulfill their destinies and join those who hunt the constant streams. They hunt the most dangerous prey - those who flaunt the natural order of events and pervert the flow of time. For which prey is more dangerous than those who can ensure you were never born to stop them?</div> </div> </div> </div>And here I was mostly just thinking Bone Shadows because eerie omen-dogs or Iron Masters because architecture and angles or Storm Lords because worrying Claimed with precognition\u2026 and now list-filling has given me cause to worry about the implications of a time-based Host.<br /> <br /> The hypothetical version of the Lodge of Tindalos that draws from the Blood Talons, naturally, hunts themselves. :P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-30T17:54:04-07:00","id":245103,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/201675-idigam-chronicle-weekly-discussion-hunting-grounds?p=245082#post245082\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And here I was mostly just thinking Bone Shadows because eerie omen-dogs or Iron Masters because architecture and angles or Storm Lords because worrying Claimed with precognition\u2026 and now list-filling has given me cause to worry about the implications of a time-based Host.<br /> <br /> The hypothetical version of the Lodge of Tindalos that draws from the Blood Talons, naturally, hunts themselves. :P</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, I could see any Blood Talon members of this hypothetical lodge, as envisioned by Bunyip, as basically policing the other members for any infractions. Of course, those infractions aren't written down, and nobody really gave the <i>Suther Anzuth</i> any permission to do so...but then, they didn't ask. And now nobody's got the stones to make them stop. But they don't seem to abuse this authority, so it's all good. Mostly.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>This space for rent.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/552-strider1276","name":"strider1276","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar552_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"382"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-30T18:02:25-07:00","id":245110,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_